    { level: 40, q: 'The tendency to see patterns or meaningful connections in random, unrelated data is\u2026', a: 'Apophenia (illusory pattern perception)', d: ['Apophenia (illusory pattern perception)', 'Confirmation bias', 'The availability heuristic', 'Anchoring'], why: 'The brain is wired to detect patterns, sometimes finding meaningful structure where none exists.' }
