    { level: 44, q: '\u201cSomatic marker hypothesis\u201d (Damasio) proposes that emotions/bodily feelings\u2026', a: 'Guide and speed up decision-making, rather than just get in the way of it', d: ['Guide and speed up decision-making, rather than just get in the way of it', 'Play no role in rational decisions', 'Only affect decisions in children', 'Always make decisions worse'], why: 'Damasio argued gut feelings act as fast, useful signals that steer decisions, especially under uncertainty.' }
